==Swedish==

===Noun===
{{sv-noun-reg-er}}
'''växt'''

# [[plant]], [[vegetable]]
# [[growth, size, length]] (about human and animal bodies and sometimes plants)
:# ''vara liten i '''växten''''' = ''be a short person'' (literally: ''be small in (the) size/growth'')
:# ''stanna i '''växten''''' = ''stop growing'' (literally: ''stop in the growth'')

===Verb===
'''växt'''

# supine and past participle of [[växa]]

====Synonyms====
* [[vuxit]] (alternative supine)

